# HyperMOS SukiSU Ultra v4.2.1 manager: user-app installation.
# Invoke PackageManager only when Android reports boot complete.
# Running as the stock shell UID/SELinux domain avoids early /data/adb access.
# This is a one-shot action per boot, not a persistent background service.
on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    exec_background - shell shell -- /system/bin/sh /system_ext/etc/hypermos-root/install-user-manager.sh
